    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our other interesting games</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/a65df0641495c1537803227526e6faff.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>100 hidden Cthulhu fish is a hidden objects/ clicker game.<br><br>The game is loosely inspired by motifs from the world created by H. P. Lovecraft, decorated with hand-drawn humorous graphics.<br><br>There are 100 fish hiding on each map. Your task is to find them all. There are four maps in total, which gives a total of 400 fish to find (wow!).<br><br>There are many games in which we look for hidden cats, but have you ever looked for the grotesque fish that Cthulhu himself hid?<br><br>- 4 levels<br>- 400 funny fish<br>- hand-drawn graphics<br>- progress record<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/12564f77eb8ee73b40c88758ed2579da.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>controls :<br><br>left mouse button - click on the fish<br><br>mouse scroll wheel - zoom in/out<br><br>hold down the right mouse button - map navigation<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/742e1e69fec3b303942cddb7b8851f86.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/a65df0641495c1537803227526e6faff.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>100 hidden Cthulhu fish is a hidden objects/ clicker game.<br><br>The game is loosely inspired by motifs from the world created by H. P. Lovecraft, decorated with hand-drawn humorous graphics.<br><br>There are 100 fish hiding on each map. Your task is to find them all. There are four maps in total, which gives a total of 400 fish to find (wow!).<br><br>There are many games in which we look for hidden cats, but have you ever looked for the grotesque fish that Cthulhu himself hid?<br><br>- 4 levels<br>- 400 funny fish<br>- hand-drawn graphics<br>- progress record<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/12564f77eb8ee73b40c88758ed2579da.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br><br>controls :<br><br>left mouse button - click on the fish<br><br>mouse scroll wheel - zoom in/out<br><br>hold down the right mouse button - map navigation<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998850/extras/742e1e69fec3b303942cddb7b8851f86.avif?t=1754900722\" width=600 height=192 /></span>",
